# End-to-end test of periodic ADC sampling through the emulator.
#
# Klippy configures a thermistor temperature_sensor; the emulator
# answers query_analog_in with periodic analog_in_state responses
# carrying scripted ADC values. Klippy decodes the values into
# temperatures via thermistor.py.
#
# Asserts klippy connected, configured, and stayed running long
# enough to consume the periodic ADC stream without erroring out.
CONFIG emulator_thermistor.cfg
DICTIONARY atmega2560.dict
EMULATOR emulator_thermistor.fixture.json

M105
M105
M105

EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "Loaded MCU 'mcu'"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Klippy is shutdown"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "ADC out of range"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Internal error"
